    "analysis": "Memos is a mature, self-hosted, Markdown-native note-taking application with a timeline-first quick-capture interface, a Go backend with SQLite/MySQL/PostgreSQL support, and a React frontend. It's for people who want to fully own their note data outside SaaS PKM tools, deployable as a single binary or Docker container, with REST/gRPC APIs and an official browser web-clipper extension. It has grown AI-adjacent features (audio/vision LLM integration for transcription and processing) while remaining primarily a personal knowledge/microblog tool.",
